    <string name="intro_root_title">Root access</string>
    <string name="intro_root_body">Sounds are deployed through root. Your root manager will ask for permission.</string>
    <string name="intro_vector_title">Enable in Vector</string>
    <string name="intro_vector_body">Turn Sound Tweaks on; make sure System Framework and System UI are selected in its scope, then reboot the device.</string>
    <string name="intro_refresh_title">Refresh SystemUI (Settings → Tools)</string>
    <string name="intro_refresh_body">If you just enabled the module or the lock/screenshot sounds do not play, this restarts SystemUI without rebooting the device. The screen redraws for a few seconds; open apps are not closed. No setting does this on its own; you are asked first.</string>
    <string name="intro_stuck_title">If something is stuck</string>
    <string name="intro_stuck_body">Settings → Tools → Generate diagnostic report shows what is not working.</string>
